WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.263
Let’s walk through Team artifacts.

00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:05.312
Read the orientation, action, or proposal together with

00:00:05.312 --> 00:00:08.662
its lifecycle label and active exercise context.

00:00:08.662 --> 00:00:11.825
Observer visibility is evidence of the record, not authority

00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:13.500
to alter or submit it.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.700
On this slide, read Strategic Orientation, actions,

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.337
or proposals and their current handoff state.

00:00:19.337 --> 00:00:21.925
In practice, compare the written record with the active

00:00:21.925 --> 00:00:23.550
exercise context;

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.350
do not edit or submit it.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.850
When you are ready, use Open Team artifacts to

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.538
move to the live surface.

00:00:30.035 --> 00:00:32.710
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:32.885
.
